Id: dbs002w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_databases
Fix: Set local-infile=0 where it is not needed.
References: mysqld(8)
Controls: CIS 3.3; NIST AC-3; ISO 8.3; CE Secure configuration

LOAD DATA LOCAL is enabled. On the server it lets a SQL user read
files off the machine connecting; on a client it lets any server the
client loads data to read the client's files. Both end in surprise
when the other side is not who it claims to be.
